    turn: You can detach 1 Xyz Material from this card; send 1 card from your Deck
    to the Graveyard. If this card in your possession is destroyed by your opponent''s
    card (by battle or card effect) and sent to your Graveyard: You can Special Summon
    1 "Burning Abyss" monster from your Extra Deck, ignoring its Summoning conditions.'
